            "text": "With the Widget Library ticket now resolved these changes could be implemented.\n\nIn addition to the patch content do not overlook the herein GNU `sed` line for the additional fix. \n\n> `https://core.tcl-lang.org/bwidget/home`\n\nBwidget Source Code\nCheck-in [0be16a0895]\n\nSpelling fixes implemented in the above.\n\n`https://github.com/tcltk/bwidget/tree/bwidget`\nbranch updated in mirror\n\nFWIW, one Bwidget branch is said to be ttk enabled.\n\n> `https://core.tcl-lang.org/widget/home`\n\nA Widget Library\nCheck-in [2c42160bbf]\n\nSpelling fixes implemented in the above including that from the herein GNU `sed` line.\n\n`https://github.com/tcltk/widget`\nno branch updated in mirror\n\n> adds reference to \"licence.terms\" in widget.tcl\n\nThe foregoing reference to \"licence.terms\" was not a subject brought up in the Widget Library ticket.",
